  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy support to CSOs core support assistance (II)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Consultancy support to CSOs core support assistance (II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges ambassad i Chisinau har ett omfattande k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsprogram f&#xf6;r moldaviska enskilda organisationer (EO/NGOs) i syfte att st&#xe4;rka och utveckla deras interna kapacitet. Ambassaden arbetar inte p&#xe5; projektbasis med dessa EO, utan enbart via k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsprogrammet. De EO ambassaden arbetar med &#xe4;r aktiva inom de omr&#xe5;den som faller inom strategin f&#xf6;r Sveriges reformsamarbete med &#xd6;steuropa, v&#xe4;stra Balkan och Turkiet 2014&#x2013;2020. 

I syfte att ge b&#xe5;de ett transparent och professionellt st&#xf6;d till arbetet med EO, upphandlade ambassaden konsulttj&#xe4;nster via ett &#xf6;ppet upphandlingsf&#xf6;rfarande. Swedish Development Advisers (SDA) valdes f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra uppdraget under 2019&#x2013;2021. Den totala budgeten f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r 2 886 601 SEK. 

I enighet med ToR, ska konsulten granska, ge rekommendationer och st&#xf6;dja genomf&#xf6;randet av bland andra de EO som genomg&#xe5;r den f&#xf6;rsta fasen av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsprogrammet (pre-core phase). Detta program genomf&#xf6;rs bland annat genom utbildningar f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dspartners. Konsulten kommer ocks&#xe5; att hj&#xe4;lpa ambassaden med uppf&#xf6;ljning av den organisatoriska utvecklingen, f&#xf6;re, under och efter k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;dsprogrammet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden in Chisinau supports a comprehensive core support programme for Moldovan CSO:s to develop their internal capacities to manage positive results in their strategic work and to support positive reforms to ensure a better life for all citizens in Moldova. The Embassy is not working with project-type support to CSO:s. Core support is the only tool used to work directly with local CSO:s. The selected organizations are active involved in the intervention areas supported by Sweden in Moldova within the Result Strategy for Sweden&#x2019;s reform cooperation with Eastern Europe, the Western Balkans and Turkey 2014-2020. 

In order to provide professional assistance in institutional development, the Embassy procured consultancy services through an open procurement procedure. Swedish Development Advisors (SDA) was selected to implement the assignment in 2019-2021. The total budget for the intervention is 2 886 601 SEK. 

According to the ToR, the contractor is supposed to be involved in conducting system-based audits, in providing recommendations and support of implementing these recommendations during the pre-core phase, in providing support to ongoing core support partners through trainings etc. The contractor will also assist the Embassy in follow-up on the organizational development during the pre-core and core support period.</narrative>
  </description>
